    "RUDDER AUTO: targets, ZERO, hold ARM + START",
    "The run: search, measure, write, verify",
    "PASS, report RUDDRnnn.TXT"
   ],
   "say": "The end points are in the servo. 1000 and 2000 microseconds now give the same throw on both sides.",
   "note": "Reference: docs/Servo.md, AUTO end points."
  }
 ]
